# Impl-2 close, the test-review remediation (decision log Impl-2 #24, 2026-11-04): key lines.
# Changes: the seven files over 300 lines split by procedure into 23 (HIGH-1..7); a fresh composed app per test in
# test-support/http-app.ts, the clock reset in atdd/sys_jobs.test.ts and an own id generator in pg-outbox.test.ts (HIGH-8
# and the two order dependences a shuffled run of every project found); the factories of test-support/solu2/fixtures.ts
# used where rows were inline (MEDIUM-1); 48 pure unit tests of the Impl-2 rules, each group broken once on purpose;
# the three unused variables of Impl-1 LOW-2 removed. Then test-review.md re-run: 100 / 100 (A), Approve.

